WEBVTT

00:00:03.340 --> 00:00:04.637
Thieves!

00:00:07.277 --> 00:00:10.180
Clever, and yet bold.
Subtle, and yet brilliant.

00:00:10.180 --> 00:00:12.949
The elusive team of thieves...

00:00:12.949 --> 00:00:16.086
That's us, Team Rose!

00:00:16.086 --> 00:00:17.986
Who the hell are you calling Team Rose?!

00:00:18.822 --> 00:00:23.226
I'll have you know, it's not like we
do this because we want the money.

00:00:23.226 --> 00:00:24.361
Liar!

00:00:24.361 --> 00:00:25.962
The majority of what we steal,

00:00:25.962 --> 00:00:28.798
we hand out to the unregistered
residents with no social security.

00:00:28.798 --> 00:00:30.322
That part is true.

00:00:31.935 --> 00:00:35.372
Robin Hoods? Aw, please!
That's totally not us.

00:00:35.372 --> 00:00:40.143
We're just fighting against
a world order that we don't like.

00:00:40.143 --> 00:00:44.748
And if we can go on a rampage doing that,
it's awesome, don't you think?

00:00:44.748 --> 00:00:48.518
Yup! That's Team Rose's way of life!

00:00:48.518 --> 00:00:51.521
Like I said, we are not Team Rose!

00:00:51.521 --> 00:00:55.992
Our official name is the
Buddy-Buddy Anderson Brothers.

00:00:55.992 --> 00:00:56.760
What?!

00:00:56.760 --> 00:00:58.862
B-Bro?!

00:00:58.862 --> 00:01:02.889
We're kind of temporarily
closed for now...

00:01:14.210 --> 00:01:17.280
Good morning.
This is your morning news.

00:01:17.280 --> 00:01:19.475
First up is news of an accident.

00:01:21.251 --> 00:01:24.587
It says the production of
enhanced linear wheels for cars

00:01:24.587 --> 00:01:27.223
has been stopped across the board.

00:01:27.223 --> 00:01:29.826
I guess the manufacturing industry
has their own problems.

00:01:29.826 --> 00:01:30.927
Hey!

00:01:30.927 --> 00:01:33.196
My luck today isn't the greatest.

00:01:33.196 --> 00:01:34.998
Solty, what month were you born?

00:01:34.998 --> 00:01:35.565
What?

00:01:35.565 --> 00:01:37.901
Oh, you don't know
when you were born, do you?

00:01:37.901 --> 00:01:39.869
Uh, right.

00:01:39.869 --> 00:01:43.306
Hey! Why are you still here?!

00:01:43.306 --> 00:01:45.942
I came to recruit Solty to become a thief.

00:01:45.942 --> 00:01:49.345
Don't you mean to say that you
came here to eat breakfast?!

00:01:49.345 --> 00:01:52.949
Look, Solty is incredibly talented!

00:01:52.949 --> 00:01:56.186
That talent should be used
for the good of the world.

00:01:56.186 --> 00:01:58.021
As a thief, of course!

00:01:58.021 --> 00:01:59.155
Don't be absurd!

00:01:59.155 --> 00:02:01.324
Becoming a thief is a little...

00:02:01.324 --> 00:02:04.227
Well, I'll be here for a while,
so take your time and think it over.

00:02:04.227 --> 00:02:05.862
Why does it end up this way?

00:02:05.862 --> 00:02:11.067
Isn't it obvious? It's a pain
to keep commuting back and forth.

00:02:11.067 --> 00:02:12.635
- Oh...
- You!
- What?!

00:02:12.635 --> 00:02:15.505
Um, both of you should try
to get along more...

00:02:15.505 --> 00:02:16.873
...weather.

00:02:16.873 --> 00:02:20.809
The forecast for today
is heavy rain all day long.

00:02:22.545 --> 00:02:30.286
Nee ima made shiritakatta
otogi-banashi no tsuzuki

00:02:30.286 --> 00:02:36.748
Eien ni owaranai
shiawase nara kono te de

00:02:38.461 --> 00:02:48.438
Bokura wa marude ichimai-chigai
no guuzen o sagashiatte

00:02:48.438 --> 00:02:50.607
Meguriatta

00:02:50.607 --> 00:02:58.681
Kimi ga itsuka
nomikonda sono kotoba yori

00:02:58.681 --> 00:03:07.624
Zutto iezu ni
itekureteta yasashisa o

00:03:07.624 --> 00:03:14.597
Shinjitai to ima omounda

00:03:14.597 --> 00:03:22.338
Nee kono saki wa doko made mo
fuan to tonari-awase

00:03:22.338 --> 00:03:28.745
Nakusu mono ga nakatta
bokutachi wa mou inai

00:03:28.745 --> 00:03:36.452
Nee ima made shiranakatta
otogi-banashi no tsuzuki

00:03:36.452 --> 00:03:42.625
Eien ni owaranai
shiawase nara kono te de

00:03:42.625 --> 00:03:46.527
Tsumikasanete
yuku mono

00:03:52.569 --> 00:03:53.336
"Revenge"

00:03:53.336 --> 00:03:55.838
"Revenge"
Are you serious about this?

00:03:55.838 --> 00:03:58.007
"Revenge"
I'm always serious.

00:03:58.007 --> 00:04:00.009
I'm making Solty one of us.

00:04:00.009 --> 00:04:04.914
If Solty joins us, our jobs
will be a lot easier to pull off.

00:04:04.914 --> 00:04:05.949
You know...

00:04:05.949 --> 00:04:08.918
You'll back me on this,
won't you, Brother Larry?

00:04:11.019 --> 00:04:12.421
It's not a bad idea.

00:04:12.421 --> 00:04:14.623
- Bro!
- I knew it!

00:04:14.623 --> 00:04:17.693
Solty Revant's physical
abilities are amazing.

00:04:17.693 --> 00:04:21.964
She will surely be a great asset
if she joins our side.

00:04:21.964 --> 00:04:25.434
But behind her is Roy Revant.

00:04:25.434 --> 00:04:27.736
I doubt that man will agree to it.

00:04:27.736 --> 00:04:29.338
I'll make him!

00:04:29.338 --> 00:04:30.372
Can you do it?

00:04:30.372 --> 00:04:33.175
- Of course!
- When?

00:04:33.175 --> 00:04:35.777
Roy Revant is a hunter.

00:04:35.777 --> 00:04:38.280
We don't know when
he might become our enemy.

00:04:38.280 --> 00:04:40.976
I can't allow you to stay
near him for long.

00:04:48.256 --> 00:04:49.992
Three days.

00:04:49.992 --> 00:04:51.393
Make it work in three days.

00:04:51.393 --> 00:04:52.060
Bro!

00:04:52.060 --> 00:04:54.796
If you realize you can't do it
in that time, give up.

00:04:54.796 --> 00:04:57.766
That is my condition as the eldest.

00:04:57.766 --> 00:04:58.667
Do you understand?

00:04:58.667 --> 00:05:00.802
Three days will be more than plenty!

00:05:00.802 --> 00:05:03.270
Nothing is impossible for me!

00:05:51.153 --> 00:05:52.421
Wh-What?

00:05:52.421 --> 00:05:55.624
Um, you seemed to be having
a pretty bad nightmare,

00:05:55.624 --> 00:05:58.360
so I was worried.

00:05:58.360 --> 00:06:00.829
I-It's no big deal.

00:06:00.829 --> 00:06:02.364
Anyway, where's the old man?

00:06:02.364 --> 00:06:04.733
He left saying he had work to do.

00:06:04.733 --> 00:06:05.634
Really?!

00:06:05.634 --> 00:06:07.302
Yes.

00:06:07.302 --> 00:06:08.370
Then...

00:06:08.370 --> 00:06:11.306
Oh, no, I will not become a thief.

00:06:11.306 --> 00:06:12.432
Darn.

00:06:19.014 --> 00:06:24.052
I heard Rose came back to recruit Solty?

00:06:24.052 --> 00:06:25.921
How did you know that?

00:06:25.921 --> 00:06:30.025
Rose told me yesterday
when we had tea together.

00:06:30.025 --> 00:06:31.526
When'd she find the time?!

00:06:31.526 --> 00:06:34.863
Do you plan to keep Solty
from becoming a thief, after all?

00:06:34.863 --> 00:06:36.298
Of course!

00:06:36.298 --> 00:06:38.066
But you know...

00:06:38.066 --> 00:06:43.138
I don't think Rose is such a bad person.

00:06:43.138 --> 00:06:44.773
She might be a thief,

00:06:44.773 --> 00:06:48.009
but she steals for the sake
of unregistered residents, right?

00:06:48.009 --> 00:06:50.812
That may be, but a criminal
is still a criminal.

00:06:50.812 --> 00:06:52.814
That's so mean, calling her a criminal!

00:06:52.814 --> 00:06:54.483
K-Kasha...

00:06:54.483 --> 00:06:59.154
Rose does it for other people!
How can you say that about her?!

00:06:59.154 --> 00:07:02.624
- I think it would be okay
for Solty to become a thief!
- N-Now, see...

00:07:02.624 --> 00:07:06.528
If she's going to work for
the good of others, Solty could also...

00:07:06.528 --> 00:07:09.865
Kasha, just what might this be?

00:07:09.865 --> 00:07:13.902
U-Um, that's...

00:07:13.902 --> 00:07:16.204
Where did you get that ring?

00:07:16.204 --> 00:07:19.196
Sorry, they caught me.

00:07:23.411 --> 00:07:27.616
So, I don't think it's a bad deal.

00:07:27.616 --> 00:07:30.986
Three meals and a nap a day,
and guaranteed minimum wage.

00:07:30.986 --> 00:07:34.256
On top of which, the more you work
the more you can earn.

00:07:34.256 --> 00:07:36.024
You get bonuses twice a year!

00:07:36.024 --> 00:07:38.994
And a room to call your own!
Talk about great benefits!

00:07:38.994 --> 00:07:41.930
You couldn't find a better job out there!

00:07:41.930 --> 00:07:45.167
So just admit it's a good deal and...

00:07:45.167 --> 00:07:49.571
H-Hey, what's the big idea?!

00:07:49.571 --> 00:07:50.805
Miss Rose?

00:07:50.805 --> 00:07:52.541
What's with that old man?!

00:07:52.541 --> 00:07:54.009
Uh, um...

00:07:54.009 --> 00:07:55.636
I'm going to stay the night here!

00:07:58.947 --> 00:08:02.217
Damn it! So I've got two days left, huh?

00:08:02.217 --> 00:08:03.685
If I knew it'd be like this,

00:08:03.685 --> 00:08:06.188
I should've asked for 3 months
instead of 3 days.

00:08:06.188 --> 00:08:08.390
The bed is ready.

00:08:08.390 --> 00:08:10.192
Say, Solty...

00:08:10.192 --> 00:08:11.921
No, I will not!

00:08:16.598 --> 00:08:18.833
Here we are, everyone.

00:08:18.833 --> 00:08:20.969
This is the memorial
monument for Blast Fall,

00:08:20.969 --> 00:08:24.005
which occurred 12 years ago.

00:08:24.005 --> 00:08:27.008
I'm sure you're all familiar with Blast Fall.

00:08:27.008 --> 00:08:30.111
Approximately 80,000 died...

00:08:30.111 --> 00:08:32.948
More like, it's a totally
impossible proposition!

00:08:32.948 --> 00:08:37.052
Convincing that old man to give in...

00:08:37.052 --> 00:08:39.321
He doesn't respect his kid's
independence, he's kind of gloomy,

00:08:39.321 --> 00:08:42.424
and he's got that temper.

00:08:42.424 --> 00:08:46.451
And Solty could be
more flexible about it, too.

00:08:54.035 --> 00:08:56.629
What a beautiful day...

00:09:27.302 --> 00:09:31.973
How long has it been
since I've relaxed like this?

00:09:31.973 --> 00:09:34.409
Pardon.

00:09:34.409 --> 00:09:37.912
Would you mind if
I joined you on your bench?

00:09:37.912 --> 00:09:43.852
My, my, an elite member of the RUC
playing hooky in a place like this?

00:09:43.852 --> 00:09:47.155
You seem to dislike members of the RUC.

00:09:47.155 --> 00:09:48.256
I do!

00:09:48.256 --> 00:09:51.092
Besides, there are other benches
that are unoccupied.

00:09:51.092 --> 00:09:56.498
Oh, dear. I can't relax and nap
if I'm not on this bench.

00:09:56.498 --> 00:09:59.701
If I go to the boring meeting
this afternoon like this,

00:09:59.701 --> 00:10:02.137
I might end up falling asleep again...

00:10:02.137 --> 00:10:08.009
I got quite an earful for it the other day
and if I did it again...

00:10:08.009 --> 00:10:10.078
You're a weird guy.

00:10:10.078 --> 00:10:14.249
All right. I'm in a good mood today,
so I'll make an exception. Go ahead.

00:10:14.249 --> 00:10:15.917
Really?

00:10:15.917 --> 00:10:17.085
Thank goodness.

00:10:17.085 --> 00:10:18.987
You sure are an odd one.

00:10:18.987 --> 00:10:23.291
You're an elite member of the RUC
and yet you nap in places like this.

00:10:23.291 --> 00:10:24.893
Do you think so?

00:10:24.893 --> 00:10:28.163
I think this is quite a nice place.

00:10:28.163 --> 00:10:33.168
Especially since I have the company
of a wonderful young lady today.

00:10:33.168 --> 00:10:37.706
Huh?! Wh-What?! Flattery won't
get you anywhere, you know!

00:10:37.706 --> 00:10:39.874
I was not flattering.

00:10:39.874 --> 00:10:43.578
You are a very charming
and attractive lady.

00:10:43.578 --> 00:10:45.013
What?

00:10:45.013 --> 00:10:47.549
What were you looking at?

00:10:47.549 --> 00:10:52.009
What was it that was
captured in your gaze?

00:10:53.188 --> 00:10:54.522
What are you talking about?!

00:10:54.522 --> 00:10:56.925
Are you trying to hit on me,
just because you've got some good looks?

00:10:56.925 --> 00:11:00.122
Well, too bad for you!
I've got stuff to take care of!

00:11:01.663 --> 00:11:03.961
Let us meet again.

00:11:05.934 --> 00:11:08.870
That's right! I don't have time for this!

00:11:08.870 --> 00:11:10.633
Oh, darn it all!

00:11:12.974 --> 00:11:16.137
Don't say anything,
just sign this contract!

00:11:18.346 --> 00:11:19.973
- Get out!
- Ow!

00:11:22.050 --> 00:11:23.818
- Sheesh!
- You are here again?

00:11:23.818 --> 00:11:25.979
What a stubborn old man!

00:11:41.536 --> 00:11:44.004
So tomorrow's my last day...

00:11:45.673 --> 00:11:48.335
What if I just tie her up
once and for all...

00:12:01.356 --> 00:12:05.427
So, come on, what makes you
so unhappy about it?

00:12:05.427 --> 00:12:07.395
If you've got a problem, just tell me!

00:12:07.395 --> 00:12:09.697
I will not allow Solty to become a thief.

00:12:09.697 --> 00:12:12.534
You know, we may be thieves,
but we properly...

00:12:12.534 --> 00:12:15.136
A criminal is a criminal!

00:12:15.136 --> 00:12:16.371
Oh, really?!

00:12:16.371 --> 00:12:20.608
- Um, Miss Rose... Mr. Roy...
- I see, so that's what you think.

00:12:20.608 --> 00:12:23.678
No wonder you're not
interested in listening to me.

00:12:23.678 --> 00:12:25.480
- I've been wasting my time here!
- Miss Rose!

00:12:25.480 --> 00:12:27.248
Totally wasting my time!

00:12:27.248 --> 00:12:29.484
Since it's come to this, I've only
got one means left to me!

00:12:29.484 --> 00:12:31.152
I have no choice but to resort to force!

00:12:31.152 --> 00:12:32.554
I dare you to try it.

00:12:32.554 --> 00:12:33.646
Mr. Roy!

00:12:35.423 --> 00:12:36.691
Miss Rose?

00:12:36.691 --> 00:12:38.158
Miss Rose!

00:12:50.538 --> 00:12:52.640
Miss Rose!

00:12:52.640 --> 00:12:54.164
Miss Rose!

00:12:56.077 --> 00:12:57.066
You idiot!

00:12:59.147 --> 00:13:00.014
Stop!

00:13:00.014 --> 00:13:03.279
Damn you! Don't you run from me! Stop!

00:13:04.686 --> 00:13:06.821
Damn it! He got away!

00:13:06.821 --> 00:13:10.959
Damn! He's alive! Damn!

00:13:10.959 --> 00:13:12.360
M-Miss Rose...

00:13:12.360 --> 00:13:14.429
Damn it!

00:13:14.429 --> 00:13:16.795
Damn it!

00:13:24.272 --> 00:13:26.908
So, how is Rose?

00:13:26.908 --> 00:13:29.342
She seems to have calmed down a little.

00:13:32.413 --> 00:13:34.649
But I can't believe it.

00:13:34.649 --> 00:13:37.952
To think Rose would become so upset...

00:13:37.952 --> 00:13:41.856
Did you see the person
Rose was talking about?

00:13:41.856 --> 00:13:44.425
No, I couldn't tell who it was.

00:13:44.425 --> 00:13:46.861
That's what we need to find out, right?

00:13:46.861 --> 00:13:49.364
I'll try hacking into
the city's security system.

00:13:49.364 --> 00:13:50.465
Thanks.

00:13:50.465 --> 00:13:55.164
14:45, at Memphis and 35th.

00:13:57.972 --> 00:13:59.837
There's quite a few.

00:14:02.043 --> 00:14:05.947
It'll take time to identify him
out of all of these.

00:14:05.947 --> 00:14:08.750
If only there was
some good way to do this...

00:14:08.750 --> 00:14:09.951
There is.

00:14:09.951 --> 00:14:11.111
What?

00:14:26.534 --> 00:14:27.535
Miss Rose...

00:14:27.535 --> 00:14:29.437
Are you feeling calmer now?

00:14:29.437 --> 00:14:30.572
Miss Rose.

00:14:30.572 --> 00:14:31.973
Don't get in my way.

00:14:31.973 --> 00:14:36.077
This is my problem,
so don't get in my way.

00:14:36.077 --> 00:14:37.476
Miss Rose!

00:14:43.985 --> 00:14:48.356
I never expected you to be
asking to see us, Roy Revant.

00:14:48.356 --> 00:14:50.824
This came in handy.

00:14:51.826 --> 00:14:54.989
That idiot! She put our
contact information on there!

00:14:59.601 --> 00:15:02.070
So? What do you want?

00:15:02.070 --> 00:15:04.937
See any familiar faces in here?

00:15:07.875 --> 00:15:08.743
Him!

00:15:08.743 --> 00:15:10.111
He's alive?!

00:15:10.111 --> 00:15:12.447
Who?!

00:15:12.447 --> 00:15:17.118
Answer me! Rose's attitude
changed when she saw him!

00:15:17.118 --> 00:15:20.688
The man's name is John Kimberly.

00:15:20.688 --> 00:15:22.323
Eight years ago,

00:15:22.323 --> 00:15:26.928
he killed Rose's best friend
and her parents right in front of Rose.

00:15:26.928 --> 00:15:28.293
What?!

00:15:35.603 --> 00:15:38.072
What do you want with me, little missy?

00:15:38.072 --> 00:15:40.942
Following me all the way out here...

00:15:40.942 --> 00:15:45.046
Does the name Irene Hayes ring a bell?

00:15:45.046 --> 00:15:46.748
Can't say it does.

00:15:46.748 --> 00:15:51.119
It's the name of the girl you killed
during a robbery 8 years ago!

00:15:51.119 --> 00:15:54.822
Come on now, don't point
that dangerous thing at me.

00:15:54.822 --> 00:15:55.923
You've got the wrong guy.

00:15:55.923 --> 00:15:57.492
The hell I have the wrong guy!

00:15:57.492 --> 00:15:59.460
I haven't forgotten!

00:15:59.460 --> 00:16:03.564
That face I saw! Your face!

00:16:03.564 --> 00:16:05.800
I really don't remember.

00:16:05.800 --> 00:16:07.435
I can't help it.

00:16:07.435 --> 00:16:11.906
I've killed dozens of people
to make my living.

00:16:11.906 --> 00:16:15.777
If I wanted money, I'd kill.
If I got hungry, I'd kill.

00:16:15.777 --> 00:16:17.845
You can't expect me
to remember every one of them.

00:16:17.845 --> 00:16:19.779
Like that little brat.

00:16:21.082 --> 00:16:22.316
Reflective coating?!

00:16:22.316 --> 00:16:25.787
Sorry, but I make a point
of eliminating all witnesses!

00:16:25.787 --> 00:16:28.256
What?!

00:16:28.256 --> 00:16:30.658
Kimberly is a cunning man.

00:16:30.658 --> 00:16:33.027
He only targets unregistered residents.

00:16:33.027 --> 00:16:35.730
Since Kimberly himself
is an unregistered resident,

00:16:35.730 --> 00:16:38.166
the police never make
a big deal out of those cases.

00:16:38.166 --> 00:16:41.436
Damn it! We'd heard he'd been killed!

00:16:41.436 --> 00:16:45.206
If Rose runs into Kimberly, the first thing
she'll think of is revenge.

00:16:45.206 --> 00:16:47.875
Let's hurry, Bro!
We have to stop Rose!

00:16:47.875 --> 00:16:48.807
Yeah.

00:16:52.280 --> 00:16:53.181
Hello?

00:16:53.181 --> 00:16:55.149
It's me. Is that you, Kasha?

00:16:55.149 --> 00:16:57.385
Rose rushed off somewhere!

00:16:57.385 --> 00:16:59.787
Solty said she'd go let you know.

00:16:59.787 --> 00:17:01.989
And Rose was all scary and told us
not to get in her way!

00:17:01.989 --> 00:17:04.892
- Kasha, calm down.
- Mr. Roy!

00:17:04.892 --> 00:17:06.757
- Solty!
- Mr. Roy!

00:17:12.033 --> 00:17:13.801
That thing won't work on me!

00:17:13.801 --> 00:17:15.928
If I can hit him where
he's not resemblized...

00:17:19.407 --> 00:17:21.602
You're too soft, little missy!

00:17:23.544 --> 00:17:25.444
Looks like we have a winner.

00:17:27.048 --> 00:17:28.447
We'll see about that.

00:17:31.919 --> 00:17:33.284
Wha?!

00:17:38.926 --> 00:17:41.395
Whoops. Sorry about that.

00:17:41.395 --> 00:17:43.564
I got serious there in spite of myself.

00:17:43.564 --> 00:17:46.294
Had enough yet? Give it up.

00:17:47.735 --> 00:17:51.466
I told you, didn't I?!
I eliminate all witnesses!

00:18:03.918 --> 00:18:05.987
Rose! Hey, Rose!

00:18:05.987 --> 00:18:07.288
What was that sound just now?!

00:18:07.288 --> 00:18:09.390
- Andy!
- Bro!

00:18:09.390 --> 00:18:12.627
Miss Rose! Are you all right, Miss Rose?!

00:18:12.627 --> 00:18:15.396
Why did you come here?!
Don't get in my way!

00:18:15.396 --> 00:18:17.598
I have to avenge Irene's death!

00:18:17.598 --> 00:18:20.401
Irene was my very first friend.

00:18:20.401 --> 00:18:25.236
She taught me all sorts of things.
How to talk... How to play...

00:18:26.908 --> 00:18:28.910
But...

00:18:28.910 --> 00:18:32.914
...Irene was killed right before my eyes.

00:18:32.914 --> 00:18:36.111
And I couldn't do anything!

00:18:43.691 --> 00:18:48.062
This city won't use
the law to protect us,

00:18:48.062 --> 00:18:51.299
but instead, it tries
to bind us with those laws.

00:18:51.299 --> 00:18:53.201
That's why I'm going to protect them!

00:18:53.201 --> 00:18:54.335
All of them!

00:18:54.335 --> 00:18:56.704
All the unregistered residents!

00:18:56.704 --> 00:18:58.806
What's wrong with being a thief?!

00:18:58.806 --> 00:19:01.542
It's not like anyone
does anything for us!

00:19:01.542 --> 00:19:04.812
I don't want to go through
something like that again!

00:19:04.812 --> 00:19:07.906
I don't want to, ever again!

00:19:09.584 --> 00:19:12.186
Miss Rose...

00:19:12.186 --> 00:19:13.585
Mr. Roy.

00:19:15.723 --> 00:19:17.291
- I guess it can't be helped.
- What?

00:19:17.291 --> 00:19:18.526
You can find him?

00:19:18.526 --> 00:19:20.084
Leave it to me!

00:19:23.631 --> 00:19:26.259
Damn. I didn't think she had friends.

00:19:28.502 --> 00:19:29.764
I have found you!

00:19:32.707 --> 00:19:33.674
Wh-What the?!

00:19:33.674 --> 00:19:35.198
That will not work on me!

00:19:46.520 --> 00:19:47.755
Rose!

00:19:47.755 --> 00:19:49.357
This is for Irene!

00:19:49.357 --> 00:19:51.392
D-Don't.

00:19:51.392 --> 00:19:54.228
Please don't!
I'm begging you, have mercy!

00:19:54.228 --> 00:19:55.696
Shut up!

00:19:55.696 --> 00:19:57.398
Shut up! Shut up!

00:19:57.398 --> 00:20:01.736
Irene begged for her life
just like that and you killed her!

00:20:01.736 --> 00:20:03.304
You die, too!

00:20:03.304 --> 00:20:04.505
Don't do it, Rose!

00:20:04.505 --> 00:20:05.806
Shut up!

00:20:05.806 --> 00:20:08.798
- Don't kill him, Rose!
- Please, have mercy!

00:20:14.548 --> 00:20:15.810
Rose...

00:20:17.151 --> 00:20:18.311
Miss Rose...

00:20:33.267 --> 00:20:34.835
Thanks for everything.

00:20:34.835 --> 00:20:38.306
If you mean it, hurry up
and take this one home with you.

00:20:38.306 --> 00:20:40.608
No, I don't think I will.

00:20:40.608 --> 00:20:45.012
It would be cruel to awaken
a sleeping child.

00:20:45.012 --> 00:20:48.282
I don't think it's such
a bad deal for you, either.

00:20:48.282 --> 00:20:50.618
If you maintain your connection with us,

00:20:50.618 --> 00:20:53.688
it will be easier for you
to find certain things.

00:20:53.688 --> 00:20:55.756
You sure you should trust me?

00:20:55.756 --> 00:20:58.159
I saw how you were earlier.

00:20:58.159 --> 00:21:00.361
So, yes, I can trust you.

00:21:00.361 --> 00:21:04.265
Having a connection with a hunter
is attractive to us as well.

00:21:04.265 --> 00:21:05.789
Do what you want.

00:21:07.868 --> 00:21:09.096
Later.

00:21:53.679 --> 00:21:58.450
Hareta hi no kouen

00:21:58.450 --> 00:22:01.386
Miageta sora ni

00:22:01.386 --> 00:22:09.953
Kiesou ni natta chiisana
Little Cloud

00:22:12.664 --> 00:22:17.436
Kaze ni mi o makasete

00:22:17.436 --> 00:22:20.372
Jiyuu ni ikiru

00:22:20.372 --> 00:22:28.413
Sukoshi-zutsu
aruku watashi-tachi

00:22:28.413 --> 00:22:33.185
Onnaji dane

00:22:33.185 --> 00:22:37.923
Taisetsu na jikan

00:22:37.923 --> 00:22:41.760
Deau tabi ni

00:22:41.760 --> 00:22:51.303
Hitori ja nai kono kimochi
yasashisa ni naru

00:22:51.303 --> 00:22:57.876
Dareka o shinjiru
yuuki ni kaete

00:22:57.876 --> 00:23:10.186
Kitto kono mama ano sora
no hate ni kieru mae ni

00:23:16.762 --> 00:23:18.330
Hey, who's that woman?!

00:23:18.330 --> 00:23:19.831
Hey, who's that man?!

00:23:19.831 --> 00:23:22.367
Say, what are you guys doing?

00:23:22.367 --> 00:23:24.770
Next time, "Girls' Day Off".

00:23:24.770 --> 00:23:26.704
I will train hard!
